---
layout: layouts/sections.liquid
template: product
pagination:
  data: products
  size: 1
  alias: product
permalink: "/products/{{ product.handle }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ product.title }} ({{ product.size }})"
  description: "{{ product.summary }}"
sections:
  - type: product-main
  - type: how-to
    settings:
      style: dark
      eyebrow: How to use
      heading: Shake. Pump. Work it in.
      text: Sixty seconds, then get to work.
      note: For the strongest warming sensation, apply after a brief sweat or a warm shower.
    blocks:
      - { image: step-shake, icon: shake, title: "Shake", text: "Shake the bottle well so the botanicals are evenly mixed." }
      - { image: step-pump, icon: pump, title: "Pump", text: "One or two pumps into your palm. A little goes a long way." }
      - { image: step-rub, icon: rub-in, title: "Work it in", text: "Rub it into the muscles and joints you are about to load. Kit on a minute later." }
  - type: feature-split
    settings:
      style: paper
      image: oil-macro
      image_ratio: 4x5
      position: 40% 50%
      eyebrow: Built to stay out of your gear
      heading: Glides on. Soaks in. Gone.
      text: |
        An oil-based formula designed to glide over the skin and absorb fast, so it works into the muscle instead of sitting on top. No residue on your gloves, no stains on your gi, nothing in your eyes when you sweat.
    blocks:
      - { icon: non-greasy, title: "Non-greasy, non-staining", text: "No added colorants, so clothes, towels and sheets stay clean." }
      - { icon: shatter-proof, title: "Shatter-proof bottle", text: "Amber plastic that protects the formula and survives the gear bag." }
      - { icon: botanical, title: "Naturally derived", text: "Arnica, Thai Plai and turmeric in a safflower and soybean oil base." }
  - type: testimonials
    settings:
      style: paper-2
      eyebrow: From the roster
      heading: Trusted in the corner.
      cta_label: All testimonials
      cta_url: /pages/testimonials/
  - type: related
  - type: faq
    settings:
      eyebrow: Questions
      heading: Good to know.
      limit: 6
---
